    "description": "<p><strong>Engram</strong></p><p><strong>Psionic Blast:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> and unleash a raw psionic attack against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to deal <strong>d6 + your Power Trait</strong> energy damage using your Proficiency.</p><p><strong>Vertigo:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to make them become temporarily <em>Dazed</em>.</p><p><strong>Telepathic Link: Spend a Hope</strong> to open a mental communication channel with one target you can see. This link lasts until your next rest or you form another Telepathic Link.</p>",
